msgid "Datasets and Models"
msgstr "Dataset과 Model"

msgid "LeRobot dataset viewer showing synchronized camera observations and joint trajectories."
msgstr "동기화된 camera observation과 joint trajectory를 보여주는 LeRobot dataset viewer입니다."

msgid ""
"The current workflow trains **GR00T 1.7** through LeRobot and records data with **Isaac Lab 3.0, "
"Newton physics, and ovrtx**."
msgstr "현재 workflow는 LeRobot으로 **GR00T 1.7**을 학습하고 **Isaac Lab 3.0, Newton physics, ovrtx**로 data를 기록합니다."

msgid "Current Model Selection"
msgstr "현재 Model 선택"

msgid ""
"The base model is [nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B). Post-train"
" it for the SO-101 task using [GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md); the base weights alone are not "
"a task policy."
msgstr ""
"Base model은 [nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-3B)입니다. [GR00T Post-"
"Training](10-groot.md)으로 SO-101 task에 맞추세요. Base weight만으로는 task policy가 되지 않습니다."

msgid ""
"The selected policies below provide three starting points for the lessons. All use GR00T 1.7; "
"their training data and camera names differ. All three checkpoints are public; access was checked"
" on October 8, 2026."
msgstr ""
"아래 세 policy는 실습의 출발점입니다. 모두 GR00T 1.7이지만 training data와 camera 이름이 다릅니다. 세 checkpoint는 공개되어 있으며 "
"원문에서 접근을 확인한 날짜는 2026년 10월 8일입니다."

msgid "The icons show the data used to post-train each policy. Green means used; gray means not used."
msgstr "Icon은 post-training에 사용한 data를 나타냅니다. 초록은 사용, 회색은 미사용입니다."

msgid ""
"The sim-only policy recorded **94/100 simulation successes** at an execution horizon of 16 "
"actions, 30 Hz, and a 30-second simulated time limit, with scene seeds 76000–76099 and workshop "
"source `f892b1a08c088e55156a389b3f1e42ab5eaa1049`. This is a recorded benchmark, not an expected "
"score from the ten-episode lesson on a later source revision. It does not measure real-robot "
"success or reliable return-and-restart behavior. The selected co-trained checkpoint has no "
"published success rate; compare it on your station."
msgstr ""
"Sim-only policy는 action horizon 16, 30 Hz, simulated time limit 30초, scene seed 76000–76099, "
"source `f892b1a08c088e55156a389b3f1e42ab5eaa1049`에서 **simulation 100회 중 94회 성공**을 기록했습니다. 이후 "
"revision의 10-episode 실습 예상 점수나 실제 성공률·안정적인 복귀/재시작 성능을 뜻하지 않습니다. 선택된 Co-Trained checkpoint에는 공개 "
"성공률이 없으므로 본인 station에서 비교하세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Johnny42: Real-to-Real Reference"
msgstr "Johnny42: Real-to-Real Reference"

msgid ""
"Trained on [50 real demonstrations](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-nv/so101-clean-up-"
"vials-into-rack-50_20260628_131121), with camera keys `wrist` and `front`. Its saved action chunk"
" and execution horizon are both 16. Use the training instruction: **Pick up the vials and put "
"them in the yellow rack**. See the pinned [configuration](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-nv/so101"
"-clean-up-vials-into-rack-50-groot-n17-relact-bs64-20k-"
"20260628_johnny_42/blob/981f41e4f5b4dda47c6583de502dcac258bf5312/config.json) and [model "
"card](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-nv/so101-clean-up-vials-into-rack-50-groot-n17-relact-bs64"
"-20k-20260628_johnny_42/blob/981f41e4f5b4dda47c6583de502dcac258bf5312/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"[실제 demonstration 50개](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-nv/so101-clean-up-vials-into-"
"rack-50_20260628_131121)로 학습했으며 camera key는 `wrist`, `front`입니다. Action chunk와 execution horizon은"
" 모두 16입니다. Training instruction **Pick up the vials and put them in the yellow rack**을 사용하세요. 고정된"
" [configuration](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-nv/so101-clean-up-vials-into-rack-50-groot-n17"
"-relact-bs64-20k-20260628_johnny_42/blob/981f41e4f5b4dda47c6583de502dcac258bf5312/config.json)과 "
"[model card](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-nv/so101-clean-up-vials-into-rack-50-groot-n17-relact-"
"bs64-20k-20260628_johnny_42/blob/981f41e4f5b4dda47c6583de502dcac258bf5312/README.md)를 확인하세요."

msgid "Select or download Johnny42"
msgstr "Johnny42 선택 또는 Download"

msgid "To load from the Hub:"
msgstr "Hub에서 로드:"

msgid "To download the reviewed revision and use its local files instead:"
msgstr "검토된 revision을 내려받아 local 파일 사용:"

msgid "Follow the [Johnny42 camera and instruction settings](johnny42-real-rollout) before running it."
msgstr "실행 전에 [Johnny42 camera와 instruction 설정](johnny42-real-rollout)을 따르세요."

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Vision-Trainable 20k: Sim-Only Reference"
msgstr "Vision-Trainable 20k: Sim-Only Reference"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This policy starts from the GR00T base and trains for 20,000 updates on [500 scripted Newton "
"demonstrations](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923). It uses "
"`wrist` and `external`, with 32 supervised action steps; the reported evaluation executes 16 "
"actions per prediction. The [model card](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_vision_h32_b32_20k_20260929/blob/bbfef9eaecc7a7654f42aaa4ceb95245bb140a53/README.md)"
" reports 94/100 successes (Wilson 95% interval: 87.5–97.2%). Physical screening found promising "
"behavior with gripper hesitation and no return-to-start behavior; no counted real success rate is"
" available."
msgstr ""
"GR00T base에서 [scripted Newton demonstration 500개](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_20260923)로 20,000 update를 학습합니다. `wrist`, `external`을 사용하고 32-action-step "
"supervision을 적용하며, 보고된 평가는 prediction당 16개 action을 실행합니다. [Model card](https://huggingface.co"
"/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_newton_dr500_vision_h32_b32_20k_20260929/blob/bbfef9eaecc7a7654f42aaa4ceb95245bb140a53/README.md)는"
" 94/100 성공(Wilson 95% 구간 87.5–97.2%)을 보고합니다. 실제 예비 관찰에서는 가능성을 보였지만 gripper hesitation과 시작점 미복귀가 "
"있었으며 집계된 실제 성공률은 없습니다."

#, python-format
msgid "Select or download the 94% simulation policy"
msgstr "94% Simulation Policy 선택 또는 Download"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "Sim75 + Real10: Co-Trained Reference"
msgstr "Sim75 + Real10: Co-Trained Reference"

msgid ""
"This policy combines [75 simulated teleoperation episodes](https://huggingface.co/datasets"
"/sreetz-nv/so101_sim_manual_perception_newton_20261008) with [10 real "
"demonstrations](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-nv/so101_real_manual). All 85 episodes are"
" used together throughout training. The simulated demonstrations use the Perception-DR "
"environment; both sources use `wrist` and `external` cameras."
msgstr ""
"[Simulation teleoperation episode 75개](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_sim_manual_perception_newton_20261008)와 [실제 demonstration "
"10개](https://huggingface.co/datasets/sreetz-nv/so101_real_manual)를 결합하고 학습 내내 총 85개를 함께 사용합니다. "
"Simulation data는 Perception-DR environment이며 두 source 모두 `wrist`, `external` camera를 사용합니다."

msgid ""
"Training runs for 20,000 updates with vision trainable, language frozen, and an effective batch "
"of 64 (microbatch 16, accumulated over four steps). The policy uses a 16-action window and "
"relative arm actions. See the [published training recipe](https://huggingface.co/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_real10_sim75_vision_h16_b64_20k_20261011/blob/c7e8049753be5629e73eda69b57a358146bbeb5d/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"Vision trainable, language frozen, effective batch 64(microbatch 16을 4 step 누적)로 20,000 update를 "
"학습합니다. 16-action window와 relative arm action을 사용합니다. [공개 training recipe](https://huggingface.co"
"/sreetz-"
"nv/so101_real10_sim75_vision_h16_b64_20k_20261011/blob/c7e8049753be5629e73eda69b57a358146bbeb5d/README.md)를"
" 확인하세요."

msgid ""
"A matched simulation evaluation is still pending, and preliminary real trials are not a "
"benchmark. Compare its sim and real behavior using the same rollout settings."
msgstr ""
"조건을 맞춘 simulation 평가는 아직 남아 있으며 예비 실제 trial은 benchmark가 아닙니다. 같은 rollout 설정으로 simulation과 실제 동작을 "
"비교하세요."

msgid "Select or download the co-trained teleoperation policy"
msgstr "Co-Trained Teleoperation Policy 선택 또는 Download"

msgid ""
"Sim + Cosmos GR00T 1.7 checkpoints remain to be prepared for both augmentation mixes. For source "
"data and validation requirements, see [Augmenting Datasets With Cosmos](14-strategy3-cosmos.md)."
msgstr ""
"두 augmentation mix의 Sim + Cosmos GR00T 1.7 checkpoint는 아직 준비가 필요합니다. Source data와 검증 조건은 "
"[Augmenting Datasets With Cosmos](14-strategy3-cosmos.md)를 확인하세요."

msgid "Download Models for the Workshop Container"
msgstr "Workshop Container용 Model Download"

msgid ""
"Preparing event stations? Use the [Workshop Preparation Reference](workshop-preparation.md) to "
"cache the models used by the lesson commands."
msgstr "행사 station 준비에는 [Workshop Preparation Reference](workshop-preparation.md)에 따라 실습 model을 cache하세요."

msgid ""
"On the **host**, run these commands from the cloned repository directory with the `hf` CLI "
"installed. Create the `outputs/`, `datasets/`, and `models/` directories before starting the "
"container. Each download goes into `models/`, which the workshop container mounts automatically."
msgstr ""
"`hf` CLI가 설치된 **host**의 cloned repository directory에서 실행합니다. Container 시작 전에 `outputs/`, "
"`datasets/`, `models/`를 만드세요. Download는 자동 mount되는 `models/`에 저장합니다."

msgid ""
"If `hf` is only installed in your workshop container, run the three `hf download` commands from "
"`/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop` inside it instead. They write to the same mounted host "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"`hf`가 container에만 있다면 내부 `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop`에서 세 `hf download` 명령을 실행합니다. 같은"
" host-mounted folder에 저장됩니다."

msgid ""
"The [container launch command](06-get-the-code.md#start-the-workshop-container) mounts `./models`"
" at `/workspace/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop/models`. No image rebuild is needed. Inside the "
"container, select one downloaded model before evaluation:"
msgstr ""
"[Container 실행 명령](06-get-the-code.md#start-the-workshop-container)은 `./models`를 `/workspace/Sim-"
"to-Real-SO-101-Workshop/models`에 mount합니다. Image rebuild는 필요하지 않습니다. 평가 전에 container에서 model 하나를 "
"선택합니다."

