msgid ""
"Use this local `MODEL_ID` in the evaluation command in place of the lesson's Hub ID. Keep the "
"full downloaded directory, including its saved processors."
msgstr "실습의 Hub ID 대신 이 local `MODEL_ID`를 평가 명령에 사용합니다. 저장 processor를 포함한 전체 directory를 유지하세요."

msgid "Create Your Own Dataset and Policy"
msgstr "직접 Dataset과 Policy 만들기"

msgid ""
"**Collect** leader-arm demonstrations into `<user>/so101_teleop_vials_newton`, or use [Automated "
"Data Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection) to record "
"`<user>/so101_auto_vials_newton`."
msgstr ""
"Leader-arm demonstration을 `<user>/so101_teleop_vials_newton`에 **수집**하거나 [Automated Data "
"Collection](08-simulation-teleoperation.md#optional-automated-data-collection)으로 "
"`<user>/so101_auto_vials_newton`을 기록합니다."

msgid ""
"**Inspect** episodes with `lerobot-dataset-viz`, using the same repo ID and `--root "
"./datasets/<repo_id>`, then **upload** the completed dataset to that Hub repository."
msgstr ""
"같은 repo ID와 `--root ./datasets/<repo_id>`로 `lerobot-dataset-viz`에서 episode를 **검토**하고 완성 dataset을 "
"해당 Hub repo에 **upload**합니다."

msgid ""
"**Train** using [GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model). Set "
"`DATASET_NAME` to the dataset you collected. The examples name the resulting policy "
"`<user>/<dataset_name>_GR00T17` and save local checkpoints under `outputs/train/`."
msgstr ""
"[GR00T Post-Training](10-groot.md#reference-post-train-your-own-model)으로 **학습**합니다. "
"`DATASET_NAME`을 수집한 dataset으로 지정하세요. 예시 model 이름은 `<user>/<dataset_name>_GR00T17`, local "
"checkpoint 위치는 `outputs/train/` 아래입니다."

msgid "**Evaluate** the same policy first in simulation and then on the real robot."
msgstr "같은 policy를 simulation에서 먼저, 실제 robot에서 다음으로 **평가**합니다."

msgid ""
"The README's mount layout preserves datasets, downloaded models, and training outputs on the host"
" when the container exits."
msgstr "README의 mount 구성은 container 종료 후에도 dataset, download model, training output을 host에 보존합니다."

msgid "Checkpoint Compatibility"
msgstr "Checkpoint 호환성"

msgid ""
"For the current workflow, use a LeRobot policy repository or a checkpoint's `pretrained_model` "
"directory containing weights, configuration, and processor artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Weight, configuration, processor artifact를 포함한 LeRobot policy repo 또는 checkpoint의 "
"`pretrained_model` directory를 사용하세요."

msgid "Verify:"
msgstr "확인 사항:"

msgid "GR00T 1.7 base model and compatible LeRobot configuration."
msgstr "GR00T 1.7 base model과 호환되는 LeRobot configuration"

msgid ""
"Image features matching the checkpoint: `observation.images.wrist` and "
"`observation.images.external` for the selected sim-only and co-trained policies; "
"`observation.images.wrist` and `observation.images.front` for Johnny42."
msgstr ""
"Checkpoint와 같은 image feature: 선택된 sim-only/Co-Trained policy는 `observation.images.wrist`, "
"`observation.images.external`; Johnny42는 `observation.images.wrist`, `observation.images.front`"

msgid "Joint order: shoulder pan, shoulder lift, elbow flex, wrist flex, wrist roll, gripper."
msgstr "Joint 순서: shoulder pan, shoulder lift, elbow flex, wrist flex, wrist roll, gripper"

msgid "Matching joint normalization, camera calibration, task geometry, and 30 Hz data."
msgstr "일치하는 joint normalization, camera calibration, task geometry, 30 Hz data"

msgid "Saved relative-action preprocessing/postprocessing, including the gripper exclusion."
msgstr "Gripper exclusion을 포함한 저장된 relative-action preprocessing/postprocessing"

msgid "An evaluation action horizon no larger than checkpoint chunk size."
msgstr "Checkpoint chunk size 이하의 evaluation action horizon"

msgid ""
"A camera rename map only maps feature names; it cannot repair different camera geometry, joint "
"conventions, or a raw Isaac-GR00T checkpoint format."
msgstr ""
"Camera rename map은 feature 이름만 바꿉니다. Camera geometry, joint 규약, raw Isaac-GR00T checkpoint format"
" 차이를 해결하지는 못합니다."

msgid "Download a Compatible Policy"
msgstr "호환되는 Policy Download"

msgid ""
"Inside the workshop container, **authenticate**, **set** the model ID to your trained policy, and"
" **download** it:"
msgstr "Container에서 **인증**하고 학습한 policy의 model ID를 **설정**한 뒤 **download**합니다."

msgid "The `models/` mount preserves downloads on the host."
msgstr "`models/` mount가 download를 host에 보존합니다."

msgid ""
"If the download contains nested checkpoints, **select** the appropriate `pretrained_model` "
"directory for evaluation."
msgstr "Nested checkpoint가 있다면 평가용 `pretrained_model` directory를 **선택**합니다."

msgid ""
"If the downloaded repository stores the policy configuration, weights, and processors at its "
"root, **set** the local path in the same container shell:"
msgstr "Repo root에 policy configuration, weight, processor가 있다면 같은 container shell에서 local 경로를 **설정**합니다."

msgid ""
"Otherwise, set `MODEL_ID` to the nested `pretrained_model` directory. Pass it as "
"`--pretrained_name_or_path \"$MODEL_ID\"` for simulation or `--policy.path=\"$MODEL_ID\"` for "
"real rollout. To load directly from the Hub instead, retain the repository ID and skip this "
"local-path assignment."
msgstr ""
"그렇지 않으면 `MODEL_ID`를 nested `pretrained_model` directory로 설정하세요. Simulation은 "
"`--pretrained_name_or_path \"$MODEL_ID\"`, 실제 rollout은 `--policy.path=\"$MODEL_ID\"`로 전달합니다. "
"Hub에서 직접 로드하려면 repository ID를 유지하고 local 경로 설정을 생략하세요."

msgid "System Identification References"
msgstr "System Identification 참고 자료"

msgid ""
"[System Identification](15-strategy4-sysid.md) uses [Anchor-Lab's SO-101 "
"telemetry](https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Anchor-Lab) for measurement inspection and the "
"[AnchorBench paired bundle](https://huggingface.co/VigneshBhavan/so101-newton-actuator-ab-paired-"
"checkpoints) for actuator profiles and training records. Its [paired "
"demonstrations](https://huggingface.co/datasets/VigneshBhavan/so101-newton-actuator-ab-paired-"
"demos) provide the policy-training data for that comparison."
msgstr ""
"[System Identification](15-strategy4-sysid.md)은 측정 검토에 [Anchor-Lab SO-101 "
"telemetry](https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Anchor-Lab)를, actuator profile과 학습 기록에는 "
"[AnchorBench paired bundle](https://huggingface.co/VigneshBhavan/so101-newton-actuator-ab-paired-"
"checkpoints)을 사용합니다. [Paired demonstration](https://huggingface.co/datasets/VigneshBhavan/so101"
"-newton-actuator-ab-paired-demos)은 해당 비교의 policy-training data입니다."

msgid ""
"These resources have distinct purposes: Anchor-Lab contains signal-level telemetry; the paired "
"demonstrations contain policy-training episodes. The comparison checkpoints are GR00T N1.6 "
"artifacts, not validated GR00T 1.7 replacements for the course rollout commands."
msgstr ""
"Anchor-Lab은 signal-level telemetry, paired demonstration은 policy-training episode를 제공합니다. 비교 "
"checkpoint는 GR00T N1.6 artifact이며 현재 과정의 GR00T 1.7 rollout을 대체하도록 검증되지 않았습니다."

msgid "Historical Course Artifacts"
msgstr "이전 과정 Artifact"

msgid ""
"These links preserve the data and policies associated with the earlier lessons. They are "
"references for studying the strategies, not validated replacements for current Newton/GR00T 1.7 "
"artifacts. Check camera schema and calibration before reusing their data. Do not rename a "
"`grootn16` repository to imply that 1.7 weights exist."
msgstr ""
"이전 실습의 data와 policy 링크입니다. 전략 연구용 참고이며 현재 Newton/GR00T 1.7 artifact의 검증된 대체물이 아닙니다. Data 재사용 전에 "
"camera schema와 calibration을 확인하세요. `grootn16` repo의 이름을 바꿔 1.7 weight가 있는 것처럼 표현하지 마세요."

msgid "Historical Datasets"
msgstr "이전 Dataset"

msgid "Browse historical demonstration datasets"
msgstr "이전 Demonstration Dataset 보기"

msgid "Historical Models"
msgstr "이전 Model"

msgid "Browse historical policy checkpoints"
msgstr "이전 Policy Checkpoint 보기"

